        "runId": "ada-en-1794263606047-afmpnw",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Over 14 days, you'll visit two countries and discover several very different parts of South America. The Peruvian leg begins in Lima on the Pacific coast, then climbs into the Andes to Cusco and Machu Picchu before continuing to high-altitude Lake Titicaca. After returning to Lima, you'll fly to Colombia to explore Bogotá, the legendary Lake Guatavita, the underground Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá and Cartagena on the Caribbean Sea."
